.TH P4KX-MCP 1 "" "P4KX" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
p4kx-mcp \- Model Context Protocol server for local Star Citizen Archives
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B p4kx-mcp
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
P4KX provides read-only tools over the Model Context Protocol on standard input
and standard output. Configure an MCP client to launch this command.
The --archive option selects a Channel or an absolute Archive path.
The --help option lists all server options.
It contains no game files or Archive key.
.SH FILES
Settings and the stored Archive key are in the P4KX directory below
XDG_CONFIG_HOME, or ~/.config when that variable is absent.
P4KX_FOLDERS_ROOT selects an absolute isolated root for config, cache and data.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR p4kx (1),
.BR p4kx-gui (1)
.PP
https://github.com/p4kx-org/p4kx/blob/main/docs/commands.md
